cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CarbonIQ in academic research, software benchmarks, or sustainable computing studies, please cite it as below."
title: "CarbonIQ: A Constraint-Aware Agentic Platform for Explainable Carbon-Conscious Software Workload Scheduling"
abstract: "CarbonIQ is an open-source platform uniting macro-level cloud infrastructure accounting (AWS CUR) with micro-level developer compute optimization. It provides an autonomous multi-agent accounting engine, an AST-driven green code refactoring optimizer, a carbon-aware scheduling CLI, and VS Code developer integration."
